# Files present in the repo that must NOT be published to the web.
#
# On S3 this was enforced by --exclude flags in deploy.sh. Vercel deploys the
# repo as-is, so that protection has to be restated here or it disappears with
# deploy.sh. Verified 2026-07-31: /DESIGN.md returned HTTP 200 on both the S3
# site and the Vercel preview before this file existed.

# Internal strategy docs. Also gitignored, so they should never reach a
# deployment anyway. Kept here as defense-in-depth: if docs/ is ever removed
# from .gitignore, this still prevents publication.
docs/

# Repo and agent documentation
CLAUDE.md
DESIGN.md
README.md
.claude/
.gstack/
.worktrees/

# Legacy deploy tooling (removed after the AWS decommission completes)
deploy.sh

# Local backups, should never be committed but belt-and-braces
s3-backup/
archive-backup/

# NOTE: documents/artifacts/*.md are intentionally NOT ignored. They are linked
# from index.html and are meant to be public.
